note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/arest-launch.om: arlaunch (gpu/nvidia/om/apirest/launch.om); Q is its 16 q words, the output its 20 words. Composed before arest.om.
text t_name "AREST-LAUNCH"
text t_au "launch"
fn arop q view ulong 64 nq ulong ny ulong o edit ulong 128 to ulong
if or ne nq 16 ne ny 20
ckbad
end
a = new ulong 16 0
for i ulong 16
put a i get q i
end
y = new uint 20 0x5a5a5a5a
r = arlaunch a y
for i ulong 20
put o i ulong get y i
end
ret r
end
